      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Vendor documentation, model binaries, private transcripts, and generated build caches are not copied into the Docs corpus. The user dataset remains outside Git. The original JSON verification evidence stays with the dataset and task outputs; this corpus preserves its aggregate results and limits."
