    "b-60-documentation-inventory-use-the-connected-docs-t-19": {
      "id": "b-60-documentation-inventory-use-the-connected-docs-t-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Use the connected Docs tools or their supported CLI bridge. Begin a task, read the page, apply typed operations with the current revision hash, run completion checks, and end the task. Never hand-edit doc.json or component sidecars. Native pages are canonical, and any remaining Markdown source is a migration reference."
